    <string name="about_privacy_full">Rizqflow stores all your financial data only in this app\'s storage on this device, separate for each account. There\'s no server, no third-party tracker, and no ads.\n\nSigning in with Google only uses your identity (name, email, profile photo) to open your workspace; we don\'t read your contacts or files. If you connect Gmail, that access is only used to recognize transaction receipts and is never sent to anyone else.\n\nSigning in with a username and password stores the password as a hash, not plain text, and only on your device.\n\nUninstalling the app deletes all your data with no backup elsewhere. Export and encrypted backup are coming in a future version.</string>
